{
  "name": "Rendley — Catalogue Video at Scale",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Catalogue Video at Scale\n\nRuns on a schedule. Reads product rows from a Google Sheet and, for each row, asks the **Rendley AI Video Agent** to build a short product clip from the row's photo, title, price and call to action. The flow polls the agent job, exports the MP4, copies it to your Google Drive and writes the link back to the sheet.\n\n**Set up:** add your Rendley credential, connect Google Sheets and Google Drive, set `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and `YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID`.\n\n**Sheet layout:** a `Products` tab with the columns `title`, `price`, `media_url` (public image URL) and `cta`, plus an empty `Results` tab. Edit the prompt in **Start Agent** to change the style.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-about",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credits\nThe agent and the export need a **paid Rendley plan** (HTTP 402 otherwise) and consume **credits per row**: music, captions and the export together are roughly **~30-80 credits** per clip. Multiply by your row count and check your balance in app.rendley.com before a big batch.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-plan-and-cost",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why poll here?\nRendley has no outbound webhooks, so a workflow follows a job by polling. A batch keeps each row as one linear branch inside the loop: **Wait, then Agent > Get Job, then If**. n8n offloads waits of 65 s or more, so the 70 s Wait costs no execution time. A failed or cancelled job leaves the loop through **Job Failed?** and is logged to the sheet instead of polling forever.\n\nThe export itself is short, so **Export Video** waits inline.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-why-poll",
      "name": "Why poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Links expire, copy every file!\nRendley **export URLs expire after ~4 hours** and **presigned media URLs after ~3 hours**. Each row's MP4 is downloaded and re-uploaded to your own Google Drive before the sheet is updated, so nothing is lost when the link expires.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-expiry",
      "name": "Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-schedule",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Products"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-read-product-rows",
      "name": "Read Product Rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        20,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-loop-over-rows",
      "name": "Loop Over Rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "node-all-rows-done",
      "name": "All Rows Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "agent",
        "operation": "run",
        "prompt": "=Create a 10-second vertical (9:16) product video for \"{{ $json.title }}\".\n\n1. Use the attached product photo as the full-frame visual with a slow, smooth zoom in.\n2. Show the title \"{{ $json.title }}\" as a bold caption from the first second, and the price \"{{ $json.price }}\" right under it in a smaller size.\n3. In the last 3 seconds add the call to action \"{{ $json.cta }}\" as a large centered caption.\n4. Add upbeat background music, faded out at the end.\n\nKeep every element inside the 9:16 frame and report the final duration.",
        "files": {
          "file": [
            {
              "url": "={{ $json.media_url }}",
              "name": "product-photo"
            }
          ]
        },
        "additionalOptions": {},
        "waitForCompletion": false
      },
      "id": "node-start-agent",
      "name": "Start Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        560
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "j1",
              "name": "job_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.job_id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "j2",
              "name": "project_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.project_id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "j3",
              "name": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Loop Over Rows').item.json.title }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-track-job",
      "name": "Track Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 70,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "node-wait",
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        900,
        560
      ],
      "webhookId": "catalogue-agent-wait"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "agent",
        "operation": "getJob",
        "agentJobId": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.job_id }}"
      },
      "id": "node-agent-job-status",
      "name": "Agent Job Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        560
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "done1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-job-done-",
      "name": "Job Done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fail1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fail2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "canceled",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fail3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "cancelled",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fail4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "waiting_input",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-job-failed-",
      "name": "Job Failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        800
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "export",
        "operation": "render",
        "projectId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.project_id }}"
        },
        "settings": {
          "target_resolution": "1080p",
          "quality": "high"
        },
        "waitForCompletion": true,
        "pollInterval": 15,
        "pollTimeout": 30
      },
      "id": "node-export-video",
      "name": "Export Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-download-mp4",
      "name": "Download MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "={{ ($('Track Job').item.json.title || 'catalogue').replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9-_]/g,'-') + '.mp4' }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-save-to-google-drive",
      "name": "Save to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2000,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Results"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "title": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.title }}",
            "drive_link": "={{ $json.webViewLink }}",
            "drive_file_id": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "error": ""
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-write-result-to-sheet",
      "name": "Write Result to Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        2220,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Results"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "title": "={{ $('Track Job').item.json.title }}",
            "drive_link": "",
            "drive_file_id": "",
            "error": "={{ $json.error || $json.last_message || $json.status }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-write-failure-to-sheet",
      "name": "Write Failure to Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1560,
        800
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Product Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Product Rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Loop Over Rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "All Rows Done",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Start Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Start Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Track Job",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Track Job": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Agent Job Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Agent Job Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Job Done?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Job Done?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Export Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Job Failed?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Job Failed?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write Failure to Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Export Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download MP4",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download MP4": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Save to Google Drive": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write Result to Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write Result to Sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write Failure to Sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
